graph TD
    User[10,000 Concurrent Buyers] --> CDN[Cloudflare CDN / WAF]
    CDN --> ALB[AWS Application Load Balancer]
    
    subgraph Kubernetes Cluster (AWS EKS)
        ALB --> GatewayPod[API Gateway Pods x10]
        GatewayPod --> InvPod[Inventory Microservice Pods x20]
        GatewayPod --> PayPod[Payment Microservice Pods x10]
        GatewayPod --> OrdPod[Order Microservice Pods x10]
    end

    subgraph Data Tier (Managed Cloud Services)
        InvPod --> Aurora[AWS Aurora PostgreSQL Primary Writer]
        PayPod --> Aurora
        OrdPod --> Aurora
        GatewayPod --> ElastiCache[(Redis Cluster Cache)]
        PayPod --> MSK[Apache Kafka Cluster MSK]
        MSK --> OrdPod
    end
